# Mapbox SDK download credentials (TEMPLATE — committed, no real secrets).
#
# The Mapbox Maps SDK for iOS is distributed through a private binary registry.
# Swift Package Manager authenticates the DOWNLOAD using a SECRET downloads
# token (an "sk." token) read from your ~/.netrc file.
#
# This token is DIFFERENT from the public runtime token (see
# iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig.template). The sk. token is used only at build time to
# fetch the SDK; the pk. token is used at runtime to load map tiles.
#
# SETUP (one time, per developer machine):
#   1. In the Mapbox account dashboard, create a SECRET access token with the
#      "Downloads: Read" scope. It starts with "sk.".
#   2. Create or edit the file ~/.netrc in your home directory.
#   3. Add the block below, replacing sk.PLACEHOLDER with your real sk. token.
#   4. Restrict permissions so only you can read it:
#        chmod 600 ~/.netrc
#
# Do NOT commit your real ~/.netrc. This template documents the required
# format only; the real file lives OUTSIDE the repo (in your home directory).

machine api.mapbox.com
login mapbox
password sk.PLACEHOLDER
